DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260810T153000
UID:tribe-10001840@weavervillenc.org
DESCRIPTION:Chi Gong is an ancient Chinese holistic set of exercises that 
 includes various postures and slow physical movements. These actions are a
 ccompanied by concentration\, breathing techniques\, and meditation. Chi G
 ong improves balance and coordination\, enhances physical and emotional en
 ergy\, and promotes an experience of well-being with an appreciation of th
 e cycles and wisdom of nature.Led by David Ezra. Email djez55@gmail.com wi
 th questions.
LOCATION:Albert Weaver Room\, Weaverville Community Center\, 60 Lakeshore 
 Dr\, Weaverville
